"Intelligent Systems Program and `The Robotics Institute "
"<http://www.ri.cmu.edu/>`__ (established in 1979 to conduct basic and "
"applied research in robotic technologies), part of the `School of Computer "
"Science <http://www.cs.cmu.edu/>`__, at `Carnegie Mellon University "
